Hi all,

The master branch of the xfstests repository at:

	git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/fs/xfs/xfstests-dev.git

have just been updated. This is a huge update as there's a tree-wide update
made by Dave that convert most parts of fstests to SPDX license tags to reduce
boilerplate text in each test, thanks a lot to Dave for doing this! Please note
that this is not a complete conversion, there're going to be more patches
comming along the way.

Other than that, there're new tests for swapfile and xfs, and several bug
fixes, including some fixes for recent regressions.

There should be no new failures introduced by this update, but there're quite a
few infrastructure updates recently, if you find new regressions please report
and/or contribute fixes, thanks!

Thanks,
Eryu

The new head of the master branch is commit:

3805d7e97a9e fstests: make lsqa.pl work with SPDX tags

New commits:

Amir Goldstein (2):
      [668a411a739c] overlay: nicer report when features are not supported
      [b22c18ca9c01] generic/401: fix test in case of no filetype support

Darrick J. Wong (6):
      [dcc690e862f5] xfs/439: don't check filesystem afterwards
      [65022a47fc5a] xfs/122: fix sb_fname[XFSLABEL_MAX] in test
      [0fca2e52331b] xfs/310: fix _require_scratch_nocheck ordering
      [4609a0009d11] xfs: abstract xfs_info into $XFS_INFO_PROG
      [8585efc1e6eb] xfs: make sure pretty printed geometry output matches
      [25ce9740065e] generic: test swapfile creation, activation, and deactivation

Dave Chinner (10):
      [06dc7f12ad36] check: fail tests if check/dmesg are not clean
      [99f34d071464] fstests: Add LICENSES directory
      [98a3b42b423d] common: convert to SPDX license tags
      [f3faa8173a1f] fstests: convert new test template to SPDX tags
      [cf89aed92414] generic: convert tests to SPDX license tags
      [2529c9486a99] xfs: convert tests to SPDX license tags
      [1ff419293269] btrfs: convert tests to SPDX license tags
      [0c1a95d06703] fstests: convert remaining tests to SPDX license tags
      [f3e65e91503f] fstests: convert top level files and tools to SPDX
      [3805d7e97a9e] fstests: make lsqa.pl work with SPDX tags

Xiao Yang (2):
      [f99695e4da59] common/rc: Fix _require_xfs_io_command for scrub probe
      [f7f040063c1a] xfs: Regression test for vulnerable directory integrity check

xiaoli feng (1):
